<title>UK: Brit Gas sees first take-or-pay deals soon.</title>
<headline>Brit Gas sees first take-or-pay deals soon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Gas Plc chairman Richard Giordano said on Thursday he hopes to conclude &quot;two or three&quot; small take-or-pay gas contract renegotiations &quot;quickly&quot; in order to show the way for the rest of the industry.</p>
</text>
